0DEC  13                      INC     DE
0DED  10 F7                   DJNZ    ?SWAP
0DEF  AF                      XOR     A
0DF0  C9                      RET
                      
                      ; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                      ;  PUSHR/PUSHR2 – Register sichern (Ziel von RST 20h)
